ustrate how points can be clustered using minimum spanning trees. I hope that y
ou will be able to flip through the pictures and identify problems that might b
e relevant to you. These pictures are augmented with more formal problem descri
ptions to eliminate the ambiguity inherent in a purely pictorial representation
.[] 
