d search operations? - Static data structures (like sorted arrays) suffice in a
pplications when there will be no modifications to the data structure after it 
is first constructed. Semi-dynamic data structures, which support insertion but
 not deletion, can have significantly simpler implementations than fully dynami
c ones.[] 
