 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Problem description: Represent each subset so as to efficien
tly (1) test whether $u_{i} \in S_{j}$, (2) compute the union or intersection o
f $S_{i}$ and $S_{j}$, and (3) insert or delete members of $S$.[] 
