in a binary tree can be associated with a field that records the name of its su
bset. Set identification queries and single element modifications can be perfor
med in the time it takes to search the dictionary. But union/intersection opera
tions are again slow. The need to perform such union operations quickly provide
s the motivation for the ...[] 
