Overfull \hbox (1749.49402pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 19588--19588
 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Discussion: "Searching" is a word that means different thing
s to different people. Searching for the global maximum or minimum of a functio
n is the problem of unconstrained optimization, discussed in Section 16.5 (page
