t model, whose vertices are cells with an edge from cell $i$ to cell $j$ iff th
e result of cell $j$ depends on cell $i$. When a given cell is modified, the va
lues of all cells reachable from it must also be updated. The identity of these
 cells is revealed by the transitive closure of $G$. Many database problems red
uce to computing transitive closures, for analogous reasons.[] 
