Overfull \hbox (1072.24599pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 19588--19588
 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Discussion: Applications of network flow go far beyond plumb
ing. Finding the most cost-effective way to ship goods between a set of factori
es and a set of stores defines a network-flow problem, as do many resource-allo
cation problems in communications networks.[] 
