. The codes HIPR and PRF CG94 are provided for maximum flow, with the proviso t
hat HIPR is recommended in most cases. For minimum-cost flow, the code of choic
e is CS Gol97. Both are written in C and available for non-commercial use from 
http://www.avglab.com/andrew/soft.html.[] 
