Overfull \hbox (1591.99448pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 19588--19588
 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Free trees do not encode any structure beyond their connec
tion topology. There is no root associated with the minimum spanning tree of a 
graph, so a hierarchical drawing will be misleading. Such free trees might well
