uch repeated subdivision eventually produces very narrow strips, where many ver
tices get crammed into a small region of the page. Try to adjust the width of e
ach strip to reflect the total number of nodes it will contain, and don\TS1/lmt
t/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 t be afraid of expanding into a neighboring region\TS
1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s turf after their shorter subtrees have been co
mpleted.\index{branch-and-bound search}[] 
