 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 - Is the graph unweighted? - If the graph is unweighted, or 
is a complete graph where all the edges have one of two possible cost values (l
ong or short), this problem reduces to finding a Hamiltonian cycle. See Section
 19.5 (page 598) for a discussion.[] 
