Overfull \hbox (2300.74242pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 19588--19588
 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 The Christofides heuristic Chr76 is an improvement over the 
minimum spanning tree heuristic and guarantees a tour whose cost is at most $3 
