ar time using dynamic programming. Conveniently, the algorithm for finding the 
shortest path in a DAG presented in Section 18.4 (page 554) does the job if we 
replace min with max. DAGs are the most interesting case of the longest-path pr
oblem for which efficient algorithms exist.[] 
