 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Computing the chromatic number of a graph is NP-complete. If
 you need an exact solution you must resort to backtracking, which can be surpr
isingly effective in coloring certain random graphs. It remains hard to compute
 a good approximation to the optimal coloring, so expect no guarantees.[] 
