lready assigned in the vertex\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s neighborhood. 
These methods vary in how the next vertex is selected and how it is assigned a 
color. Experience suggests inserting the vertices in non-increasing order of de
