ed with it than vertex coloring. Vizing\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s theo
rem states that any graph with a maximum vertex degree of $\Delta$ can be edge 
colored using at most $\Delta+1$ colors. To put this in[] 
