em is constructive, meaning it can be turned into an $O(n m \Delta)$ algorithm 
to find an edge-coloring with $\Delta+1$ colors. Deciding whether we can get aw
ay using one less color than this is NP-complete, so it hardly seems worth the 
effort to try. An implementation of Vizing\TS1/lmtt/m/n/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 s t
heorem is described below.[] 
