 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Be aware of this distinction in your application. Subgraph i
somorphism problems tend to be much harder than graph isomorphism, while induce
d subgraph problems tend to be even harder than subgraph isomorphism. Some flav
or of backtracking is your only viable approach.[] 
 []


