o simplify? The conventional approach to remove noise from a digital image is t
o take the Fourier transform of the image, filter out the high-frequency elemen
ts, and then take the inverse transform to recreate the image. See Section 16.1
1 (page 501) for details on the fast Fourier transform.[] 
