ween algorithms for string matching and substring matching. Suppose we seek to 
align the full pattern against the full text. Then the cost of $D[i, 0]$ must b
e that of deleting the first $i$ characters of the pattern, so $D[i, 0]=i$. Sim
ilarly, $D[0, j]=j$.[] 
