lty for starting the alignment in the $j$ th position of the text. The cost of 
$D[i, 0]$ remains $i$, because the only way to match the first $i$ pattern char
acters with nothing is to delete them all. The cost of the best substring patte
rn match against the text will be given by $\min _{k=1}^{n} D[m, k]$.[] 
