 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 CAP3 (Contig Assembly Program) HM99 and PCAP HWA ${ }^{+} 03
$ are the latest in a series of assemblers by Xiaoqiu Huang and his collaborato
rs, which are available from http://seq.cs.iastate.edu/. They have been used on
 mammalian scale assembly projects involving hundreds of millions of bases.[] 
