 []\T1/lmtt/m/n/10 Combinatorica PS03 is a collection of over 450 algorithms fo
r combinatorics and graph theory written in Mathematica. Combinatorica has been
 widely used for both research and education.[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (1681.24422pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 19588--19588
