ore comprehensive and better integrated than other libraries of combinatorial a
lgorithms, it is also the slowest such system available. Combinatorica is best 
for finding quick solutions to small problems, and (if you can read Mathematica
 code) as a terse exposition of algorithms for translation into other languages
.[] 
